次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。","quote_sha256":"83a818af20f1bc926d3b82a99f40c724b74d424bb2f5bb5877d194f1f72d0f93","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。","quote_sha256":"ffc6cb29d83ff1fdff1723b4d70a2e3294e7e561c3310a66660f5c81fcf62439","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_placebo_dosing"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","quote":"章节编号=6.1\n章节标题=试验用药品","quote_sha256":"cc28f090b0dabe74a8110cff91b4d4905cd595199faa4af22e71bf19217d9c82","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","span_id":"es_s1_section_6_1"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_s2_drug_identity","es_s2_drug_class","es_s2_dosage_form","es_s2_route","es_s2_dosing","es_s2_placebo_dosing","es_s1_section_6_1"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本方案试验用药品包括合成试验药A及其匹配安慰剂。合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂，试验组受试者在双盲治疗期内接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服，给药自第1天持续至第16周；对照组受试者接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次口服，给药自第1天持续至第16周双盲治疗期。试验用药品的发放、使用和回收应与双盲治疗期的盲态保持要求一致，并保证用药记录可追溯。试验用药品的制备、包装、标签、储存与管理，以及发放、回收与清点，在本章相应小节中说明。","rationale":"支持事实：试验药物为合成试验药A，对照为匹配安慰剂；剂型为口服固体制剂，给药途径为口服；试验组剂量为100 mg每日一次，给药期为第1天至第16周；对照组匹配安慰剂每日一次，第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。需医学作者核对：本节总述与后续小节关于药物信息、制备包装标签储存管理、发放回收清点的边界划分，以及是否需要补充试验用药品编号、包装规格或标签样式等细节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fc00c21a15e837a8","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_pro