ion:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。","quote_sha256":"ffc6cb29d83ff1fdff1723b4d70a2e3294e7e561c3310a66660f5c81fcf62439","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_placebo_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_adherence"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","quote":"章节编号=6.1.1\n章节标题=研究药物信息","quote_sha256":"9fa26464c44b9a370d781b406887d8199cc2f2f40c5e5f333bc7b361ea249482","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","span_id":"es_s1_section_6_1_1"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_s2_drug_identity","es_s2_drug_class","es_s2_route","es_s2_dosage_form","es_s2_dosing","es_s2_placebo_dosing","es_s2_adherence","es_s1_section_6_1_1"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"研究药物为合成试验药A，属于小分子药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，给药途径为口服。试验组受试者接受合成试验药A 100 mg，每日一次（QD），自第1天至第16周口服给药；对照组受试者接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次（QD）口服，给药期为第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。试验期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。本方案采用匹配安慰剂对照，试验药与安慰剂在双盲治疗期内按每日一次口服给药。","rationale":"支持事实：合成试验药A为小分子药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，给药途径为口服；试验组剂量为100 mg每日一次，自第1天至第16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂每日一次口服，第1天至第16周双盲治疗期；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。需医学作者核对：试验用药品规格、批号信息、安慰剂匹配方式的具体描述，以及是否需要在研究药物信息中列明药物来源或既往临床资料。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_469d7df8436fa4a2","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_co