"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_s2_drug_identity","es_s2_dosage_form","es_s2_dosing","es_s2_placebo_dosing","es_s1_section_6_1_2"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"试验用药品包括合成试验药A及其匹配安慰剂，均为口服固体制剂。试验组在第1天至第16周双盲治疗期内接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服，对照组接受匹配安慰剂每日一次口服。试验用药品的制备、包装、标签、储存与管理围绕口服固体制剂特征和双盲治疗安排，覆盖研究中心接收、保存、使用及剩余药品管理，并保持用药记录可追溯。","rationale":"支持事实：试验用药品为合成试验药A及其匹配安慰剂，均为口服固体制剂；试验组100 mg每日一次至第16周，对照组匹配安慰剂每日一次至第16周双盲治疗期。需医学作者核对：包装形式与规格、标签内容、储存条件与温控要求、制备与包装责任方、研究中心药物管理职责、记录表单及稳定性依据；上述内容未在已确认研究事实中明确，正文未写入具体参数。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_503d4369748f76ae","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922030515_9d0b3143","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。","quote_sha256":"83a818af20f1bc926d3b82a99f40c724b74d424bb2f5bb5877d194f1f72d0f93","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。","quote_sha256":"ffc6cb29d83ff1fdff1723b4d70a2e3294e7e561c3310a66660f5c81fcf62439","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_placebo_dosing"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_s2_adherence"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","quote":"章节编号=6.1.3\n章节标题=发放、回收与清点","quote_sha256":"c19d68aac6aa2ccf7bb228b83e94c11436e2ce583b7c195b7f65d36d66dc8304","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","span_id":"es_s1_section_6_1_3"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_s2_dosing","es_s2_placebo_dosing","es_s2_adherence","es_s1_section_6_1_3"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"发放、回收与清点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"试验用药品的发放、回收与清点应覆盖第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。试验组受试者接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服，对照组接受匹配安慰剂每日一次口服。发放、回收与清点应对发放数量、使用数量和剩余数量进行记录和核对，并通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。对于未使用、部分使用及回收的试验用药品，应保留相应记录，以支持双盲治疗期内用药可追溯和盲态保持。","rationale":"支持事实：双盲治疗期为第1天至第16周，试验组接受100 mg每日一次口服，对照组接受匹配安慰剂每日一次口服，依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。需医学作者核对：发放、回收与清点的具体操作流程、记录表单、责任角色、剩余药品返还或销毁路径，以及药品计数与日记卡回收的访视安排；上述内容未在已确认研究事实中明确，正文未写入具体流程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5cffa5a750f97bfc","section_number":"6.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:88efe2189933b4312fd4ef0f","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"f89e31a51efcb308010497c7200dc062518355307a7be411059d582b784eec16"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"locator":"section:5. AD 部位拍照：将在预设访视点对受试者 AD 皮损部位进行拍照，具体拍摄要求详见《特应性皮炎皮损部位拍照流程及要求》。如受试者因特殊情况|block:225|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"5b666f365d97c08cc0b89f4385d4c2eae4c9a88144f60a3b1524e66c86391897"},{"locator":"section:治疗药物|block:103|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7375ac7241c2627eeb54b287a15f75832e33a6fc655f40545738b9f13c31a384"},{"locator":"section:表3. 研究药物给药方案|block:478|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"397548cdd2222ca606599d07a45451fb1f6330b576d8c186d50126d7e8737a90"},{"locator":"section:IMP的储存、管理与发放|block:483|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"6bd1543fac3d184ef68f0f4e5c2eb8c382829bbbefe6cce8f9627ca1008b66cb"}]}